  "qualifications": [
    "Profile: sRGB ImageData in rgba-unorm8 only; display-p3 and rgba-float16 return RV_ERR_UNSUPPORTED (CanvasColorSpaceEnabled and CanvasColorTypeEnabled are off in WebCore on Windows and Linux), so RvDomImageDataSettings carries no fields.",
    "new ImageData(65536, 65536) raises RangeError in WebKit and IndexSizeError in Chromium 156.",
    "The ImageBitmap arm of drawImage is exercised in R07, which creates ImageBitmaps; HTMLVideoElement is outside the union (ENABLE_VIDEO OFF on slim) and CSSStyleImageValue is accepted but not drawn here.",
    "putImageData ignoring globalAlpha and globalCompositeOperation is in the Chromium oracle only: those setters belong to R03.",
    "Tainting is measured with a cross-origin <img> served by rv_host_set_resource_handler; crossorigin=anonymous stays readable."
  ],
